OL,3,GNEWSACyclist, 96, reunited with
OL,4,Atreasured bike in care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 96-year-old man said it was
OL,7,F"unbelievable" to see his treasured
OL,8,Fracing bicycle again after his daughter
OL,9,Farranged for it to be restored and
OL,10,Fbrought to his care home.
OL,12,FClifford Craske was a competitive
OL,13,Fcyclist for much of his life and met
OL,14,Fhis wife in Cambridge through the sport
OL,15,Fin 1947.
OL,17,FHis daughter, Alice Craske, 67,
OL,18,Farranged for the Claud Butler road bike
OL,19,Fto be transported to his care home in
OL,20,Fthe city, complete with its original
OL,21,Fsaddle and dropped handlebars, where it
OL,22,Fwill be displayed in his room.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
